      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `41d6d995b0750b575edf88490c6eb1f1ec63b3a178d4fa3bb9ad63a6bdd6c759--45100do002_2010.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 710b893bcfd415881055a484d6b0b9c439032c2277ce6982f9e646e70677b62a | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 31d858763c38a205b9f3e7cfbaf9fe69484f533b0e3bec60d044bf7ade139803 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 2534dc20a96b368eea09d5495913108a7b0a45ae4e2528a3e824f7da71e1cf00 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 43b1da3d586ce5993d049fc9bd4e40762453c85af972b86856d53f401f592800 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 8f86687be02f55fb8659544db69076f715087686be9c341ce4dc74690acc575b | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | f37eaa01cdcbfb6242c2282a0dcca0fdc6453e8a5c0aec8de04e54fe17602c04 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 34ac3cbf8f4e4fb1bd55e5bf296c175df840ace6dcc54880546bafcc2265b4a2 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | e72b0e40073760212a48c8ce477cd31e77cf26548a9a799e68a415aabbdc3582 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 5ae060f54988a323b41ea625eba6e5576db91f4593f9fc7e4ecb5ac72f459d84 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
